{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-1","title":"1 Chronicles 15:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David having prepared a place for the ark, the priests and Levites bring it from Obed-edom. 25 He performs the solemnity thereof with great joy. 29 Michal despises him.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2962. B.C. 1042. houses. 2Sa 5:9; 13:7,8; 14:24 and he prepared. 3; 16:1; 17:1-5; Ps 132:5; Ac 7:46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-2","title":"1 Chronicles 15:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>None ought to, etc. Heb. It is not to carry the ark of God,but for the Levites. them hath. Nu 4:2-15,19,20; 7:9; De 10:8; 31:9; Jos 3:3; 6:6; 2Ch 35:3 to minister. Nu 8:13,14,24-26; 18:1-8; Isa 66:21; Jer 33:17-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-3","title":"1 Chronicles 15:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>gathered. 13:5; 1Ki 8:1 to bring up. 1; 2Sa 6:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-4","title":"1 Chronicles 15:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the children of Aaron. 6:16-20,49,50; 12:26-28; Ex 6:16-22; Nu 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-5","title":"1 Chronicles 15:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Uriel. 6:22-24 brethren. or, kinsmen.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-6","title":"1 Chronicles 15:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Merari. 6:29,30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-7","title":"1 Chronicles 15:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Joel. 11; 23:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-8","title":"1 Chronicles 15:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Elizaphan. Ex 6:22 Elzaphan. Shemaiah. 11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-9","title":"1 Chronicles 15:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Hebron. 6:2; 23:12,19; 26:23,30,31; Ex 6:18; Nu 26:58</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-10","title":"1 Chronicles 15:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Uzziel. 6:18; 23:12; Ex 6:18,22 Amminadab. 6:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-11","title":"1 Chronicles 15:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Zadok. 12:28; 18:16; 1Sa 22:20-23; 2Sa 8:17; 15:24-29,35; 20:25; 1Ki 2:35 Uriel. 5-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-12","title":"1 Chronicles 15:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Ye are the chief. 9:34; 24:31 sanctify. 14; Ex 19:14,15; 2Ch 5:11; 29:4,5; 30:15; 35:6; Eze 48:11 Joh 17:17; Ro 12:1,2; Re 5:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-13","title":"1 Chronicles 15:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>ye did it. 13:7-9; 2Sa 6:3 the Lord. 13:10,11; 2Sa 6:7,8 for that. 2; Nu 4:15; 7:9; De 31:9; 2Ch 30:17-20; Pr 28:13; 1Co 11:2; 14:40 1Jo 1:8-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-14","title":"1 Chronicles 15:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>sanctified. Le 10:3; 2Ch 29:15,34; Joe 2:16,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-15","title":"1 Chronicles 15:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>bare the ark. Ex 25:12,12-15; 37:3-5; 40:20; Nu 4:6,15; 7:9; 1Ki 8:8; 2Ch 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-16","title":"1 Chronicles 15:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>And David. 2Ch 30:12; Ezr 7:24-28; Isa 49:23 chief. 12; Ac 14:23; 1Ti 3:1-15; 2Ti 2:2; Tit 1:5 the singers. 27,28; 6:31-38; 13:8; 16:42; 23:5; 25:1-6; 2Ch 29:28-30; Ne 12:36,46 Ps 87:7; 149:3; 150:3,4 lifting up. 2Ch 5:13; Ezr 3:10,11; Ne 12:43; Ps 81:1; 92:1-3; 95:1; 100:1 Jer 33:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-17","title":"1 Chronicles 15:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Heman. 6:33; 25:1-5; 1Sa 8:2 Asaph. 6:39; 25:2; Ps 73:1; 83:1; *titles Ethan. 19; 6:44 son of Kishi.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-18","title":"1 Chronicles 15:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>the second. 25:2-6,9-31 Zechariah. 16:5,6 Jaaziel. 20 Aziel. Obed-edom. 13:14; 16:5,38; 26:4,8,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-19","title":"1 Chronicles 15:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>16; 13:8; 16:5,42; 25:1,6; Ps 150:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-20","title":"1 Chronicles 15:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Aziel. 18 Jaaziel. Alamoth. Ps 46:1; *title</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-21","title":"1 Chronicles 15:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Mattithiah. 18; 16:5 harps. 25:6,7; 1Sa 10:5; Ps 33:2; 81:1,2; 92:3; 150:3 Sheminith to excel. or, eighth to oversee. Ps 6:1; 12:1; *titles</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-22","title":"1 Chronicles 15:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>for, etc. or, for the carriage: he instructed about thecarriage. song. Heb. lifting up. 16,27 he instructed. 25:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-23","title":"1 Chronicles 15:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>9:21-23; 2Ki 22:4; 25:18; Ps 84:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-24","title":"1 Chronicles 15:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>the priest. 16:6; Nu 10:8; 2Ch 5:12,13; Ps 81:13; Joe 2:1,15 Obed-edom. 18,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-25","title":"1 Chronicles 15:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>David. 2Sa 6:12,13-23; 1Ki 8:1 captains. Nu 31:14; De 1:15; 1Sa 8:12; 10:19; 22:7; Mic 5:2 Obed-edom. 13:14 with joy. 13:11,12; De 12:7,18; 16:11,15; 2Ch 20:27,28; Ezr 6:16; Ps 95:1,2 Ps 100:1,2; Php 3:3; 4:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-26","title":"1 Chronicles 15:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>God. 29:14; 1Sa 7:12; Ac 26:22; 2Co 2:16; 3:5 they. 2Sa 6:13; Ps 66:13-15 bullocks. Nu 23:1,2,4,29; 29:32; Job 42:8; Eze 45:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-27","title":"1 Chronicles 15:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>a robe. 1Sa 2:18; 2Sa 6:14 Chenaniah. 22 song. or, carriage. 22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-28","title":"1 Chronicles 15:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>brought up. 2Sa 6:15 with shouting. 16; 13:8; 2Ch 5:12,13; Ezr 3:10,11; Ps 47:1-5; 68:25; 98:4-6 Ps 150:3-5 the cornet.Jerome on Ho 5:8 says this instrument is properly called in Greek [keratine,] from [keras ,] a horn. The trumpets were, according to Josephus, made of metal, and about a cubit in length. See Note on Nu 10:2.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-15-29","title":"1 Chronicles 15:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>as the ark. 17:1; Nu 10:33; De 31:26; Jos 4:7; Jud 20:27; 1Sa 4:3; Jer 3:16 Heb 9:4 Lord. 2Sa 6:16 Michal. 1Sa 18:27,28; 19:11-17; 25:44; 2Sa 3:13,14 dancing. Ex 15:20; Ps 30:11; 149:3; 150:4; Ec 3:4; Jer 30:19; 33:11 she despised. 2Sa 6:20-23; Ps 69:7-9; Ac 2:13; 1Co 2:14; 2Co 5:13</p>"}]}